// Package repository is the persistence boundary: it exposes this project's models upwards and depends on nothing but
// the framework auth package's Store interface downwards. | Package repository 是持久化边界：向上只暴露本项目模型，
// 向下只依赖框架 auth 包的 Store 接口。
//
// Auth data lives in a real database: Open reads the db section of the configuration, opens the pool, migrates it and
// injects the GORM implementation into auth.Service, so tenants, users, roles and permissions survive a restart and are
// shared by every replica of this project. | 鉴权数据存放在真实数据库里：Open 读取配置的 db 段打开连接池、执行迁移，
// 再把 GORM 实现注入 auth.Service，因此租户、用户、角色与权限在进程重启后依然存在，多副本也共享同一份数据。
//
// The tables belong to the framework (yd_auth_tenants / yd_auth_users / yd_auth_roles / yd_auth_role_permissions) and are created by
// security/auth/gormstore.Migrate, while internal/model only describes view types for rendering. To own the DDL, create the tables
// from the internal/model tags and replace gormstore.New with an auth.Store implementation of your own: the upper layers
// do not change at all. | 表由框架拥有（yd_auth_tenants / yd_auth_users / yd_auth_roles / yd_auth_role_permissions），
// 由 security/auth/gormstore.Migrate 创建，而 internal/model 只描述渲染用的视图类型。想接管 DDL，就照 internal/model 的标签自建表，
// 并把 gormstore.New 换成你自己的 auth.Store 实现：上层代码一行都不用改。
//
// Degradation never blocks startup: with no configured database (an empty db.dsn, which is what `yd new --db none`
// produces) or when connecting or migrating fails, Open falls back to the in-memory implementation with an explicit
// "data is not persistent" warning while the application and the authentication keep working. | 降级不阻塞启动：未配置
// 数据库（db.dsn 为空，即 `yd new --db none` 的产物）或连库、迁移失败时，Open 退回内存实现并明确告警「数据不持久」，
// 应用与鉴权照常可用。
//
// Default data is written once and only once, and never with a password nobody configured: Seed fills an empty database
// with the default tenant, the built-in roles of the authz registry together with their capability bindings, and its
// owner account, where the password comes from seed.admin_password (YD_SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD) — development falls
// back to a documented password and warns on every start, while any other environment refuses to seed at all. |
// 默认数据只写入一次，且绝不会用一枚无人配置过的口令写入：Seed 在空库里写入默认租户、authz 注册表的内置角色及其
// 能力绑定，以及该租户的所有者账号；口令来自 seed.admin_password（YD_SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD）——开发环境回退到
// 文档化的开发口令并每次启动告警，其它环境则直接拒绝写入。
{{ else -}}
